        "faq_dyDmFp": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the longevity shot gluten free? ",
            "answer": "<p>Our Longevity Shot is certified gluten-free. While it does contain wheat, it adheres to FDA regulations by keeping gluten levels below 20 parts per million (ppm), meeting the FDA’s strict standards. This makes it generally safe for individuals following a gluten-free diet. However, if you have any health concerns or sensitivities, we recommend consulting your healthcare provider before use.</p>"
