        "faq_C3dmw7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I start feeling and seeing the benefits?",
            "answer": "<p>Every body is beautifully different, so your timeline may not match your best friend’s. Still, most women notice a gentle lift in energy and a fresh, dewy glow within the first 4 weeks of enjoying two Longevity Shots per week. Inside your cells, antioxidant defenses and detox pathways are already revving up—paving the way for smoother skin and greater vitality over the next couple of months. Expect deeper wins like firmer skin and a measurable slowdown in biological aging by months two and three, but remember that the exact pace varies from person to person.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_FVkfpH": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long should I keep Longevity Shot in my routine?",
            "answer": "<p>Longevity is a lifestyle, not a quick fix. Because cellular renewal happens continually, we recommend making Longevity Shot a steady ritual—two shots each week, taken year-round. This rhythm keeps resveratrol, nicotinamide riboside, and ceramides working in harmony to protect your cells, boost skin elasticity, and support graceful, pro-aging vitality for the long haul. Think of it as an investment that pays wellness dividends every single day you keep sipping.</p>"
          }
        }
