    "faqs_XptXYA": {
      "type": "faqs",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_3AMCmz": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is NMN (Cell Renew)?",
            "answer": "<p>NMN (Nicotinamide Mononucleotide) is a direct precursor to NAD⁺, a coenzyme essential for energy production, DNA repair, and cellular health. As we age, NAD⁺ levels decline, contributing to fatigue, slower metabolism, and aging-related issues. NMN (Cell Renew) is a clean, daily formula designed to support healthy aging from the inside out.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_CUFkDg": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Key Benefits",
            "answer": "<p>- Promotes NAD⁺ production and energy metabolism</p><p>- Supports cellular repair and mitochondrial function</p><p>- Aids in combating fatigue and age-related decline</p><p>- Daily formula with clean ingredients and no artificial additives</p><p>- Liposomal delivery for superior absorption</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_Fe8fUf": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How to Use It",
            "answer": "<p>Take 6 ml daily (approximately one dropper), ideally in the morning. You can take it directly or mix with a small amount of water or juice. Store in a cool, dry place. Shake well before use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_7r77hm": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What’s the difference between NMN (Cell Renew) and the Longevity Shot?",
            "answer": "<p>Both our Longevity Shot and NMN Tonic are liposomal formulas that support NAD⁺ levels, essential for energy, cellular repair, and healthy aging. The Longevity Shot is our signature product, with NR and Resveratrol in a delicious and powerful ritual taken just twice a week. If you’re choosing one product for your longevity routine, this is the one we recommend. Some customers like to add the NMN Tonic on days they don’t take the Shot or use it while traveling, since it’s a daily option and easy to carry. <br/><br/>At Happy Aging, we offer flexible, science-backed tools so you can build the routine that fits your life best. Let us know if we can help you find your perfect combination.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_37nxqw": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I combine both products?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Many customers use the Longevity Shot twice a week and take NMN on the other days. It’s a great way to maintain daily NAD⁺ support and build a flexible longevity ritual.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4TQbLh": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why did you create both?",
            "answer": "<p>Because longevity isn’t one-size-fits-all. Some people love the Shot’s powerful, twice-weekly ritual. Others prefer a daily approach. We created both to give you options that fit your lifestyle and goals.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_HANaHM": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are they both liposomal?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Both NMN and the Longevity Shot use liposomal delivery for enhanced absorption and effectiveness.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_UNF8x6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it safe to use daily?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely. NMN (Cell Renew) is designed for daily use. However, if you’re pregnant, nursing, or taking medication, consult your healthcare provider.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_fUtkgi": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does NMN (Cell Renew) have any flavor?",
            "answer": "<p>It has a mild, natural flavor with no added sugars or artificial sweeteners.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_Peaaqi": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When is the best time to take it?",
            "answer": "<p>We recommend taking it in the morning, as part of your daily wellness routine. Some users report improved focus and energy when taken early in the day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3hHbGx": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it normal not to feel effects right away?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Effects vary from person to person. While some feel a boost in energy and focus within a few days, for others the benefits build up gradually over a few weeks. Consistency is key.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_JCGgJK": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I travel with it?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! NMN (Cell Renew) is designed to be portable and travel-friendly. Keep it in a cool place and always tighten the cap after use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_GDk38G": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is NMN vegan and allergen-free?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our formula is 100% vegan, non-GMO, and free from gluten, soy, and dairy.</p>"
          }
        }
